    "summary": "The repository runs Statecraft's github-actions-rust profile at revision 28. Revision 29 (statecraft-cli spec 073) gives the policy-isolation guard a new-crate class, so a new workspace crate that adds no dependency lands in one pull request; any registry or git package change stays policy. This spec renders it and carries spec 210's acceptance with the profile at revision 29.\n",
